{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 14, "text": "对张闻天信的批示（一九五九年八月十八日）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n146)\n对张闻天信的批示\n（一九五九年八月十八日）\n印发各同志，印一百六十多份，发给每人一份，走了的，航送或邮送去。我以极大热情欢迎洛甫这封信。\n毛泽东八月十八日\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-ef644294d3f561f450a5", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/4-146.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "1d53ebae805357d482c9969e5c3df4b527fc504bac16d6bc4e8e7abff3338c9a", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 4, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "55a024c9d024f78878dc039dd6deb115fb2813e60a7b620589441fb201b34e2e", "text_chars": 152}
